            Open WhatsApp → Pick a chat → More → Export Chat → <strong>Without Media</strong><br/>
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">(We don't need your 2,000 cat pics)</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl font-black">
          2
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Upload it here</h3>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">
            Drag & drop the .txt file. That's it. We handle the rest.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-3xl font-black">
          3
        </div>
        <div>
